    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Usiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea ispwa bea Yeroboamu sugoocheanda Israeli, hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda Yuda Usiya was orjeeda Amasiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew damwan lah. Ak ghwaak sugoocheanduumeeda gweanyeew haradam ea damaniyeenya aba Yerusalemu. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yekoliya bea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Gawuurji gidaghayi sinda ghwaan was Amasiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heetiyeada sibadiini ghadooweeda ea miyeenyarja, inyeesa gaweay buuneeda eatayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda. Ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, nea geejooysa geeta siing'andiita, heetiyeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalas NG'UTAMIIDA sugoocheanda ak ghoang'waay geeyooda udamusuura. Bwak ea ghwahita damanda miyeadaanyi ak goobiida jeeda gheeda nea gabwageaw. Nea Yotam was orjeeda sugoocheanda goombal gheeda nea gwanda madeeda buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Usiya heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Usiya ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi, mida mujiineeda Dawdi. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yotam was orjeedaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sakariya sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea damasis bea Usiya sugoocheanda Yuda, hean ghoang'waay Sakariya was orjeeda Yeroboamu sugoocheanduumeeda Israeli mida Samariya sheelah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidaghayi sinda ghweanigaaschi. Ak ea miighwanung'waada riing'eega ghayi bea Yeroboamu orjeeda Nebati, ghayi nung' goodiiy fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu Shalumu was orjeeda Yabeshi ghamwaal Sakariya ak ghabwar aba madeeda buuneeda ea gwanuus. Ng'ata gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Sakariya ng'ula sing'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasa ng'asheanda ghayi heeleesa NG'UTAMIIDA sea Yehu bea gideaba, “Orjoagaagu gaygaweay hoorgeeda sugoocheanduumeeda Israeli ea ghwahita jeateaba ang'wan.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shalumu sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu was orjeeda Yabeshi ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda gweaydeaba diktam ea damashageash, bea sugoocheanduumeeda Usiya was sugoocheanda Yuda. Ak ghwaak sheanagi aba Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwascheeng'u aba Disa Menahemu was orjeeda Gadi. Ak ghwahidu Samariya, ak ghabwar Shalumu orjeeda Yabeshi aba Samariya ea gwanuus, ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean bea Shalumu ea gidasin ea gidawalda ng'ula sing'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida Menahemu ghabwar mujiineeda Dapua, ea fuga mida jeeda sean, ea geeng'oojigaaschi ghang'eada Disa. Aba gideaba manda fuga mida meatkweadaanyi, hean ghabwar eara gadeemga was bungaroodiga nea ghabwaashaada jeesinga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Menahemu sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam ea damashageash bea sugoocheanduumeeda Usiya was sugoocheanda Yuda. Ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda Israeli Menahemu was orjeeda Gadi; ak ghwaak gweanyeew damanamughuush aba Samariya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea aba eawoojigaaschi sean ea miighwanung'waada riing'eega Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati, ghayi nung' goodiiy fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwahidu ng'eanyiida Israeli Bulu was sugoocheanda Ashuru, hean ghoadaw Menahemu Bulu dalaantaji sagalam bea lapiya. Aba gideaba gagasa weeta, nea gamajeegiit sugoocheanduumeadaanyi aba geatindaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoang'waay Menahemu gujaweedeaba lapiyeeni aba heeda fuga Israeli, was meanang'oodiga. Gaba siisi adayda shiliingaji haradam ea damanamughuush was shekeeli, gideaba ghoadaw sugoocheanda Ashuru. Iidu gabiikta sugoocheanda Ashuru ng'eanyiida nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Menahemu, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghami Menahemu, ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda orjeedaanyi was Bekahiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bekahiya sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba haradam ea damanamughuush bea sugoocheanduumeeda Usiya was sugoocheanda Yuda. Hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda Israeli mida Samariya Bekahiya was orjeeda Menahemu ak ghwaak gweanyeew iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, miighwanung'waada riing'eega ghayi bea Yeroboamu orjeeda Nebati. Ghayi nung' gwasin fuga Israeli riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beka orjeeda Remaliya was shirikarajeanda haw ambal lugoadaanyi. Hean ghamwaal nea gwandeawa fih haradam ea damanamughuush bea Gileyadi. Ak ghabwar aba Samariya aba jeeda gheeda sugoocheanda, ak ghabwar eara Argobu ea Ariye, ama ng'ata nuusta gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Bekahiya ng'ula sing'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bekahiya sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba haradam ea damaniyeenya bea sugoocheanduumeeda Usiya was sugoocheanda Yuda. Hean ghoang'eat Beka was orjeeda Remaliya sugoocheanduumeeda Israeli mida Samariya, ak ghwaak gweanyeew diktam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea miighwanung'waada riing'eega Yeroboamu orjeeda Nebati, ghayi nung' gwasin fuga Israeli riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damanda sugoocheanduumeeda Beka sugoocheanda Israeli, hean ghwahidu Diglat-bileseri sugoocheanda Ashuru. Ak ghoang'waay mujiinajeega Iyoni ea Abel-bet-maaka, ea Yanoa, ea Gadeshi, ea Hasori, ea Gileyadi, ea Galilaya ea ng'eanyiisean bea Naftali. Ak goobaleak buuneeda ea ghwahita Ashuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghang'eat Hosheya orjeeda Ela ak ghamwaal Beka was orjeeda Remaliya ak ghabwar ea gwanuus. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda, nea gweaydeaba diktam gil bea sugoocheanduumeeda Yotam orjeeda Usiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Beka ng'ula sing'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yotam sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba iyeenya bea sugoocheanduumeeda Beka orjeeda Remaliya was sugoocheanda Israeli. Hean ghoang'eat Yotam was orjeeda Usiya, sugoocheanduumeeda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda ghoang'eat sugoocheanduumeeda nea gaba gweanyeew diktam ea muut. Ak ghwaak gweanyeew damwalah aba Yerusalemu, ak gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Yerusha was hudeaba Sadoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea miyaasiin aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea gwasinda sean gidasinda Usiya was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heetiyeada sibadiini ghadooweeda ea miyeenyarja, inyeesa gaweay buuneeda eatayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda. Ea haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda, nea geejooysa geeta siing'andiita heetiyeada. Yotam dadeas gidaghuuta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA gil bea heetiyeada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheega sean sin Yotam, heapi miyeeng'oorsa jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu aba damandida ghang'eat NG'UTAMIIDA ak goojeakta Resini sugoocheanda Shaamu, ea Beka orjeeda Remaliya gang'uchi sea Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghami Yotam ak geebung'sa heeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi, aba mujiineeda Dawdi was ghwaan. Ak gawa hoorgeadaanyi bea sugoocheanduumeeda Ahasi was orjeedaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
